<code>assert c != null => this.size() == c.size();</code>
--------------------
<code>assert !c.isEmpty() => this.size() == c.size();</code>

However, since the comment specifies that the collection `c` is not null, we should directly use the size comparison without checking if `c` is empty:

<code>assert this.size() == c.size();</code>
--------------------
<code>assert c != null => this.size() == c.size();</code>
--------------------
